  "title": "8 October 1964: Recording: She's A Woman",
  "date": "1964-10-08",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>Studio Two, EMI Studios, Abbey Road<br>\nProducer: <a href=\"/people/george-martin/\">George Martin</a><br>\nEngineer: <a href=\"/people/norman-smith/\">Norman Smith</a></p><p>The Beatles recorded <a href=\"/songs/shes-a-woman/\">‘She’s A Woman’</a>, the b-side to their 1964 Christmas single <a href=\"/songs/i-feel-fine/\">‘I Feel Fine’</a>, on this day. <span id=\"more-4288\"></span></p><p>The backing track was recorded in the day’s first session, which lasting from 3.30-5.30pm.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1964/10/08/recording-shes-a-woman/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-4288 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/usa_i_feel_fine/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"196\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_i_feel_fine-200x196.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"I Feel Fine single artwork - USA\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_i_feel_fine-200x196.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_i_feel_fine-580x568.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_i_feel_fine-960x940.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_i_feel_fine-768x752.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_i_feel_fine-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_i_feel_fine.jpg 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"10247\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/usa_i_feel_fine/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_i_feel_fine.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,979\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-comments-count=\"1\" data-image-title=\"I Feel Fine single artwork – USA\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_i_feel_fine-960x940.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/sweden_i_feel_fine/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"197\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_i_feel_fine-197x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"I Feel Fine single artwork - Sweden\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_i_feel_fine-197x200.jpg 197w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_i_feel_fine-572x580.jpg 572w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_i_feel_fine-947x960.jpg 947w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_i_feel_fine-768x779.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_i_feel_fine-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_i_feel_fine.jpg 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 197px) 100vw, 197px\" data-attachment-id=\"10129\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/sweden_i_feel_fine/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_i_feel_fine.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,1014\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"I Feel Fine single artwork – Sweden\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_i_feel_fine-947x960.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/spain_i_feel_fine/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"197\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/spain_i_feel_fine-197x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"I Feel Fine single artwork - Spain\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/spain_i_feel_fine-197x200.jpg 197w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/spain_i_feel_fine-573x580.jpg 573w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/spain_i_feel_fine-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/spain_i_feel_fine.jpg 708w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 197px) 100vw, 197px\" data-attachment-id=\"10074\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/spain_i_feel_fine/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/spain_i_feel_fine.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"708,717\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"I Feel Fine single artwork – Spain\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/spain_i_feel_fine.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/norway_i_feel_fine/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTk4IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE5OCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"198\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/norway_i_feel_fine-200x198.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"I Feel Fine single artwork - Norway\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/norway_i_feel_fine-200x198.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/norway_i_feel_fine-580x574.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/norway_i_feel_fine-960x949.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/norway_i_feel_fine-768x760.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/norway_i_feel_fine-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/norway_i_feel_fine.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9843\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/norway_i_feel_fine/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/norway_i_feel_fine.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,989\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"I Feel Fine single artwork – Norway\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/norway_i_feel_fine-960x949.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/denmark_i_feel_fine/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTk4IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE5OCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"198\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_i_feel_fine-200x198.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"I Feel Fine single artwork - Denmark\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_i_feel_fine-200x198.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_i_feel_fine-580x575.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_i_feel_fine-960x952.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_i_feel_fine-768x762.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_i_feel_fine-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_i_feel_fine.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9260\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/denmark_i_feel_fine/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_i_feel_fine.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,992\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"I Feel Fine single artwork – Denmark\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_i_feel_fine-960x952.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/netherlands_i_feel_fine/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTk3IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE5NyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"197\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_i_feel_fine-200x197.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"I Feel Fine single artwork - Netherlands\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_i_feel_fine-200x197.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_i_feel_fine-580x571.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_i_feel_fine-960x946.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_i_feel_fine-768x756.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_i_feel_fine-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_i_feel_fine.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9804\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/netherlands_i_feel_fine/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_i_feel_fine.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,985\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"I Feel Fine single artwork – Netherlands\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_i_feel_fine-960x946.jpg\"></a></div></figure></div><p>The released version was take six. A longer version, known as take seven due to George Martin’s erroneous announcement at the start, was most likely actually take five; the recording circulates on bootlegs, and ends with three minutes of jamming and screaming from <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a>.</p><p>The Beatles used just two of the four available tracks during this first session. Rhythm guitar, bass guitar and drums were added to track one, and McCartney’s lead vocals were recorded onto track two.</p><p>A second session then followed from 7-10pm, in which overdubs were added to take six. McCartney re-recorded his vocals onto track two, and <a href=\"/people/george-harrison/\">George Harrison</a> added a guitar solo onto three.</p><p>Track four was used for final overdubs. McCartney added piano, <a href=\"/people/ringo-starr/\">Ringo Starr</a> shook a chocalho, and McCartney and Harrison doubled up their vocals and guitar solo respectively.</p>\n<!--[googlesitekit-end-of-content]--><div style=\"font-size: 12px; margin: 10px 0 10px 0;\"><strong>Page last updated:</strong> 5 October 2022</div></div></div><div class=\"on-this-day-wrapper\"><h3>Also on this day...</h3><ul><li>2016: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2016/10/08/paul-mccartney-live-desert-trip-festival/\">Paul McCartney live: Desert Trip festival</a></li><li>2015: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2015/10/08/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-save-on-foods-memorial-centre-victoria/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Save-On-Foods Memorial Centre, Victoria</a></li><li>2014: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2014/10/08/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-moody-theater-austin/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Moody Theater, Austin</a></li><li>2010: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2010/10/08/google-doodle-john-lennon-animation/\">Google publishes animated tribute to John Lennon</a></li><li>2010: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2010/10/08/john-lennon-fingerprint-card-seized-by-fbi/\">John Lennon fingerprint card seized by FBI</a></li><li>2005: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2005/10/08/paul-mccartney-live-mci-center-washington-dc-3/\">Paul McCartney live: MCI Center, Washington, DC</a></li><li>1990: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1990/10/08/uk-album-release-ringo-starr-and-his-all-starr-band/\">UK album release: Ringo Starr And His All-Starr Band by Ringo Starr</a></li><li>1980: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1980/10/08/mixing-cleanup-time-john-lennon-yoko-ono/\">Mixing: Cleanup Time by John Lennon and Yoko Ono</a></li><li>1977: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1977/10/08/travel-john-lennon-frankfurt-new-york/\">Travel: John Lennon – Frankfurt to New York</a></li><li>1974: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1974/10/08/mixing-be-my-baby-just-because-john-lennon/\">Mixing: Be My Baby, Just Because by John Lennon</a></li><li>1974: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1974/10/08/recording-juniors-farm-jet-wings/\">Recording: Junior’s Farm, Jet by Wings</a></li><li>1974: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1974/10/08/john-lennon-discusses-big-seven-lawsuit-maurice-levy/\">John Lennon discusses Big Seven lawsuit with Maurice Levy</a></li><li>1973: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1973/10/08/recording-bluebird-wings/\">Recording: Bluebird by Wings</a></li><li>1972: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1972/10/08/recording-mixing-lazy-dynamite-hi-hi-hi-wings/\">Recording, mixing: Lazy Dynamite, Hi, Hi, Hi by Wings</a></li><li>1971: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1971/10/08/press-preview-this-is-not-here-yoko-ono/\">Press preview: This Is Not Here by Yoko Ono</a></li><li>1971: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1971/10/08/recording-mixing-editing-tomorrow-mumbo-mumbo-link-wings/\">Recording, mixing, editing: Tomorrow, Mumbo, Mumbo Link by Wings</a></li><li>1971: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1971/10/08/uk-album-release-imagine-john-lennon/\">UK album release: Imagine by John Lennon</a></li><li>1970: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1970/10/08/mixing-all-things-must-pass-george-harrison-3/\">Mixing: All Things Must Pass by George Harrison</a></li><li>1969: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/10/08/george-harrison-interview-bbc-scene-and-heard-2/\">George Harrison is interviewed for the BBC’s Scene And Heard</a></li><li>1968: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1968/10/08/recording-long-long-long-im-so-tired-the-continuing-story-of-bungalow-bill/\">Recording: Long Long Long, I’m So Tired, The Continuing Story Of Bungalow Bill</a></li><li>1962: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1962/10/08/radio-the-friday-spectacular/\">Radio: The Friday Spectacular</a></li><li>1960: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1960/10/08/live-kaiserkeller-hamburg-5/\">The Beatles live: Kaiserkeller, Hamburg</a></li></ul><p>Want more? Visit the <a title=\"Day after day: the Beatles' history\" href=\"/history/\">Beatles history section</a>.</p></div><div class=\"gm-map\" style=\"position: relative;height: 390px; width: 100%;\"><iframe data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"about:blank\" name=\"gm-map-1\" allowfullscreen=\"\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/?geo_mashup_content=render-map&amp;map_data_key=8e07ef37e2fcee30d801c4dde2b78746&amp;height=390&amp;width=100%&amp;add_overview_control=false&amp;zoom=16&amp;enable_street_view=false&amp;map_type=G_HYBRID_MAP&amp;name=gm-map-1&amp;object_id=4288&amp;map_content=single\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none; overflow: hidden;\" title=\"Geo Mashup Map\"></iframe></div>",
  "textContent": "Studio Two, EMI Studios, Abbey Road\nProducer: George Martin\nEngineer: Norman SmithThe Beatles recorded ‘She’s A Woman’, the b-side to their 1964 Christmas single ‘I Feel Fine’, on this day. The backing track was recorded in the day’s first session, which lasting from 3.30-5.30pm.\n\n\n\n\n\nThe released version was take six. A longer version, known as take seven due to George Martin’s erroneous announcement at the start, was most likely actually take five; the recording circulates on bootlegs, and ends with three minutes of jamming and screaming from Paul McCartney.The Beatles used just two of the four available tracks during this first session. Rhythm guitar, bass guitar and drums were added to track one, and McCartney’s lead vocals were recorded onto track two.A second session then followed from 7-10pm, in which overdubs were added to take six. McCartney re-recorded his vocals onto track two, and George Harrison added a guitar solo onto three.Track four was used for final overdubs. McCartney added piano, Ringo Starr shook a chocalho, and McCartney and Harrison doubled up their vocals and guitar solo respectively.\nPage last updated: 5 October 2022Also on this day...2016: Paul McCartney live: Desert Trip festival2015: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Save-On-Foods Memorial Centre, Victoria2014: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Moody Theater, Austin2010: Google publishes animated tribute to John Lennon2010: John Lennon fingerprint card seized by FBI2005: Paul McCartney live: MCI Center, Washington, DC1990: UK album release: Ringo Starr And His All-Starr Band by Ringo Starr1980: Mixing: Cleanup Time by John Lennon and Yoko Ono1977: Travel: John Lennon – Frankfurt to New York1974: Mixing: Be My Baby, Just Because by John Lennon1974: Recording: Junior’s Farm, Jet by Wings1974: John Lennon discusses Big Seven lawsuit with Maurice Levy1973: Recording: Bluebird by Wings1972: Recording, mixing: Lazy Dynamite, Hi, Hi, Hi by Wings1971: Press preview: This Is Not Here by Yoko Ono1971: Recording, mixing, editing: Tomorrow, Mumbo, Mumbo Link by Wings1971: UK album release: Imagine by John Lennon1970: Mixing: All Things Must Pass by George Harrison1969: George Harrison is interviewed for the BBC’s Scene And Heard1968: Recording: Long Long Long, I’m So Tired, The Continuing Story Of Bungalow Bill1962: Radio: The Friday Spectacular1960: The Beatles live: Kaiserkeller, HamburgWant more? Visit the Beatles history section.",
